  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a223ef6e-ebd5-51cf-8e5c-b26ae14b88c8" activityNameId="76a38a16-3c95-5990-815d-4b53c00ab249" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Crude oil, at production offshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Crude oil, at production offshore
The offshore oil production delivers the product crude oil. The values are derived from a multioutput-process "combined offshore gas and oil production" by allocation based on heating values for crude oil and natural gas UUID=9f3c3f39-cbff-324e-ab2e-6b90a1ceb8bb
Production of crude oil including energy use, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: Data valid for CA.
Technology: 7 % offshore and  93 % onshore production
Time period: Time of most relevant publications and statistics. Other generic data, e.g. for infrastructure are based on older publications.
Production volume: 20 megatons of crude oil per year in 2023.
Sampling: Statistics and use of generic data
Extrapolations: A part of the data has been estimated with generic assumptions for offshore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9f3c3f39-cbff-324e-ab2e-6b90a1ceb8bb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="4e0f2471-1233-5677-81f6-1e8deb4ad822" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
